# 全仓文本一律 LF。
# 项目源自 Linux 宿主，源码与 Scripts/*.sh 均为 LF；若被转换为 CRLF，
# bash 脚本会以 $'\r': command not found 失败，等于回滚/重新 clone 时损坏构建链。
# 本文件优先级高于 core.autocrlf（本机该值为 true）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止任何换行转换与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.apk binary
*.idsig binary
*.msi binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.cub binary
*.pdb binary
*.lib binary
*.obj binary

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF：cmd.exe 对纯 LF 的 .bat 解析异常，
# gradlew.bat 是 Android 出包入口，改成 LF 会直接构建失败。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
